:: work
<<scenery dump>>
<<addHours 8>>\
<<set $player.workedToday = true>>\
You spend 8 hours working on your job as $player.job.name
<<cash $player.job.pay>>
You currently own ¤<<- $player.cash.toFixed(2)>>

<<keyOption "Return home" home 🏠>>
<<if $slaves.length gt 1 >>
    <<set 
        _hungryBasementSlaveCount = Basement.getHungrySlaves().length;
        _neededPizzas = Math.ceil((_hungryBasementSlaveCount * 3) / 8);
        _pizzasPrice = _neededPizzas * 9;
    >>\
    <<if _hungryBasementSlaveCount && !Player.has("pizza", _neededPizzas) && $player.cash gte _pizzasPrice>>\
        <<keyAction "Go buy pizza for all the hungry slaves in the basement (¤_pizzasPrice) and return home" 🍕>>\
            <<run
                $player.cash -= _pizzasPrice;
                Player.getInventory().add({
                    name:'Pizza',
                    description:'Median basic pizza',
                    count:_neededPizzas,
                    tags: ["player", "food", "consumable"]
                })
            >>
            <<addMinutes 10>>
            <<goto home>>
        <</keyAction>>: 10min detour\
    <</if>>\
<</if>>\
:: home
<<scenery home>>
You are currently in front of your home.
<<unlessEmergency>>
    <<keyOption "Go inside" main 🚪>>
    <<include workOption>>\
    <<keyOption "Look for kids in the playground" playground ⚽>>
<</unlessEmergency>>
:: playground
<<scenery playground>>
<<set $found_kid = Person.generate($settings.childGeneration)>>\
You found a $found_kid.age year old $found_kid.skin $found_kid.title with $found_kid.hairLength $found_kid.hairStyle $found_kid.hairColor hair \
and $found_kid.eyeColor eyes named $found_kid.name

<<set
	_hasChloroform = Player.has('chloroform');
	_hasCandy = Player.has('Candy');
>>\
<<if !_hasChloroform and !_hasCandy>>\
    (You don't have anything at your disposal to obtain kids)
<<elseif Basement.availableBeds() lte 0>>\
    (Not enough space for a new kid back at home)
<<else>>\
	<<if _hasCandy>>\
		<<keyOption "Offer $found_kid.name some Candy." CandyLure 🍬>>: 9min
	<</if>>\
	<<if _hasChloroform>>\
		<<keyOption "Kidnap $found_kid.pronoun" kidnap 🖐>>: 30min
	<</if>>\
<</if>>\
<<keyOption "Keep searching" playground 🔍>>
<<keyOption "Return home" home 🏠>>
:: kidnap
<<scenery home>>
<<set $found_kid.status to "slave"; $slaves.push($found_kid)>>\
<<addMinutes 30>>\
You start stalking the $found_kid.age year old kid waiting for the right moment.
<<run Player.removeItem("chloroform")>>
A while later you see the kid standing all alone in a corner. You look around making sure no one sees you and quickly use the chloroform \
on $found_kid.possessive mouth. (<<- Player.has('chloroform') ? Player.getInventory().get('chloroform').count : 'No'>> doses left)

Surprised, the kid takes a deep breath on the chloroform soaked handkerchief. You feel $found_kid.possessive strength quickly running out and \
$found_kid.possessive cute limbs falling right in your arms.

You cover $found_kid.possessive body in a blanket and sneak up back to your home with your new toy.

<<keyOption "Enter the basement" basement 🚪>>

:: CandyLure
<<scenery playground>>
<<set $found_kid.status to "slave"; $slaves.push($found_kid)>>\
<<addMinutes 3>>\
You sit on the park bench with a Candy Bar and wait for the $found_kid.age $found_kid.title to approach you. It 
takes a few minutes. But $found_kid.GenPronoun finally approaches you.
<<run Player.removeItem("Candy")>>
Hi, my name's $found_kid.name and I was wondering if perhaps I can have that Candybar? You smile 
and say, Unfortunately $found_kid.name this is all I have on me. BUT, you see that house down the
road? You turn and point to your house. Yeah? says the $found_kid.age yo $found_kid.title.
Well, that's my house and I have a 30 lb. Bag Of Candy downstairs. If you follow me back. You
can help yourself. (<<- Player.has('Candy') ? Player.getInventory().get('Candy').count : 'No'>> pieces left)


OK! says the $found_kid.title with SURPRISING Enthusiasm.
The $found_kid.age yo $found_kid.title follows you closely. It takes 6 minutes to reach 
your house.
<<addMinutes 6>>

You and the $found_kid.age yo enter your house. You and $found_kid.pronoun then head into the basement. 
As soon as $found_kid.name realizes what's going on $found_kid.GenPronoun tries to escape but you
quickly grab $found_kid.pronoun and chain him to the wall.

<<keyOption "Head Back Upstairs" house 🚪>>